  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "The higher timeframe gave the direction. The lower timeframe gave the entry and a tight stop.",
    "bn": "বড় timeframe দিক দিয়েছে, ছোট timeframe entry ও ছোট stop।"
